fication, fee and visa tasks separately.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/expansion-20261022/italy-florence-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-22\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-22\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/university-of-florence-admissions-scholarships/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is this a guide to every university located in Florence?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. It covers Università degli Studi di Firenze. Other institutions and overseas campuses have their own fees, awards and application routes.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does every Florence scholarship accept all nationalities?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. University calls can target particular groups. Check the named notice before preparing an application.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Should I pay for CIMEA before reading the programme instructions?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"First confirm the evidence required at assessment and enrolment. Avoid buying a service that does not match the university’s requirement.\"}}]}"}}]],"$L18","$L19","$L1a"]}]
