office. Depending on your course, the academic decision and the subsequent enrolment record are separate steps.",{"children":"The university’s non-EU student instructions connect programme assessment with the relevant registration systems and international office. Depending on your course, the academic decision and the subsequent enrolment record are separate steps."}],"$L1b"],"$L1c","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]}],false,"$L21","$L22"]}],"$L23"]}]
